sequenceDiagram
    participant ORCH as Price Change Orchestrator
    participant OUT as Publication Outbox
    participant OPUB as Outbox Publisher
    participant K as Kafka
    participant CON as Price Publication Consumer
    participant CMSA as CMS Adapter
    participant CMS as Channel Management System
    participant DT as Delivery Tracker
    participant REC as Reconciliation Worker

    ORCH->>OUT: Create outbox record with correlation ID
    OUT-->>OPUB: Pending publication
    OPUB->>K: Publish event
    OPUB->>DT: Record KAFKA_PUBLISHED
    K-->>CON: Deliver event
    CON->>DT: Record CONSUMER_RECEIVED
    CON->>CMSA: Send publication
    CMSA->>DT: Record CMS_SEND_ATTEMPTED

    alt CMS available
        CMSA->>CMS: REST push updated prices
        CMS-->>CMSA: ACK
        CMSA->>DT: Record CMS_ACK_RECEIVED
        CMSA->>DT: Record COMPLETED
    else CMS unavailable
        CMSA->>DT: Record FAILED_RETRYABLE
        CMSA-->>CON: Failure
        loop Retry until circuit breaker opens or success
            CON->>CMSA: Retry send
            CMSA->>DT: Record CMS_SEND_ATTEMPTED
        end
        REC->>DT: Detect stuck delivery
        REC->>K: Re-drive publication
    end